    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομῑμ-έομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>express by imitation, copy</i> or <i>represent
				faithfully,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.10.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					865b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Κλεοφῶντος πολιτείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.150
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἵεσθαι διὰ τοῦ ῑ ἀ.</span>
			<i>endeavour to express</i> motion by the sound of <i>i,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				427a
			</span></i> sq.: pf. in pass. sense, Moschioap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.207f
			</span></i>.</div>
